(STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Cleaning validation) Tj T*
(Document No.: SOP-QA-0026) Tj T*
(Revision: 02) Tj T*
(Effective date: 2024-06-11) Tj T*
(Site: Lakemoor) Tj T*
(Owner: Ana Galloway) Tj T*
(Approved by: Dev Quiroga) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how cleaning validation is carried out at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all cleaning validation activities in production and quality control at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Ana Galloway, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Escalate the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Verify deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Record the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Inspect the result against the acceptance criterion, and record the result on form F-262.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Confirm the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Clean the batch number.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of cleaning validation are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 Revision history) Tj T*
(Revision   Change) Tj T*
(01         Revision 01: first issue.) Tj T*
(02         Revision 02: updated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
